{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"that person logan","id":"519566652824616973","is_bot":0,"username":"thatpersonlogan"},"author_id":"519566652824616973","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"“I think you’ve made a mistake,” she looks down at her shaky hands, “Raising of the dead should not be outlawed. I understand that there are major moral issues when it comes to the practice but what happened with Web was a mistake. They didn’t know that raising the hags would cause trouble. In their tribe, undead are used to do things like farming and mending. They can be helpful. That is all that Web wants. They don’t want to cause trouble. Please. I’m afraid that this law is going to tear this town apart. And we don’t need this.” She shakes her head slightly, “not now.”","created_at":"2020-08-11T18:15:20.465000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742808388223762502","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
